  "comment": "THE PROTAGONIST, from the user's own pose sheet (art/player/source/hero-sheet.png) — made by `npm run assets:poses` from art/player/source/hero.poses.json: technical operations only (a transparent background, nothing drawn, recoloured or smoothed). The sheet has one pose per action, so each clip here is ONE frame, and 8 clips are STAND-INS (tag \"stand-in\"): they show the pose of another clip because the sheet has none of their own — dash: the run: the sheet's dash pose is a red streak, not a figure; attack2: the first blow: the sheet's second blow cannot be separated from its red arc; aerialAttack: the first blow: the sheet has no blow in the air; crouch: the landing crouch: the sheet has no crouch; crouchAttack: the first blow, a low lunge: the sheet has no blow from the crouch; death: the hit: the sheet has no death; drink: standing: the sheet has no drinking; interact: standing: the sheet has no interaction. `npm run assets:missing` counts them as NOT delivered. Hand over real frames for a clip and the stand-in goes away.",
